        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "🧾 The abacus beads CLICK — AUDIT DAY. The clipboard flips to YOUR sheet: \"strike\" flagged INEFFICIENT. Taxed: half strength for 2 rounds. (Deliberate jank between audits keeps the good stuff off the sheet.)"
