        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "You go down."
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "OH. Oh no. ...The gamblers are very quiet."
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "📺 ───"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "📺 While you fought your fight, they fought theirs."
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "📺 Wave 1: The lead never reached Nikolai — it fell to the volley, and the pack's coordination shatters with it. (0 rounds, 0 taken)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "📺 Wave 2: The lead never reached Nikolai — it fell to the volley, and the pack's coordination shatters with it. (0 rounds, 0 taken)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "📺 Wave 3: The lead falls — the pack's coordination shatters. The rest scatter or die. (2 rounds, 20 taken)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "📺 Nikolai WON. You didn't see it — you had your own arena. The village will tell you about it for weeks."
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "📺 Prize for Nikolai: the winner's share — alien rations for the pantry. The village eats tonight."
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "📺 The System presses something humming into Nikolai's hands: Harvest Scythe. It was made for wheat. It works on everything. The swing is the same."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Pamela Bauer is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "Pamela is gone — dead. The errand dies with them; nobody's waiting on those dandelions now."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "🕯️ Pamela Bauer is dead — the arena. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "What Pamela kept close goes into the ground with them — keepsakes are buried, never taken from the body."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "\"Pamela's gone.\" Nikolai looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Pamela.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Rachel blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 LEARNED: Generous Heart (Level 1). Donating gives 2x trust."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 LEARNED: Come Get Some (Level 1). Make exactly the right noise and the blind thing comes to investigate. Goad a blinded monster within 3 tiles: it lurches toward the sound on its next move. Stand where you want it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 LEARNED: Steady Hands (Level 1). Fine work under pressure. Dressing game, stitching wounds, tying snares — no shake."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 LEARNED: Wound Care (Level 1). Clean it, close it, cover it. Pressure stops bleeding. Clean water is better than dirty hands."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "⚡ TECHNIQUE UNLOCKED: Precise Mend! Your healing knows where to go. +50% effectiveness. (Your knowledge of Wound Care amplifies your field_medicine.)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "\"OH! OH! PRECISE MEND! The audience did NOT see that coming! Knowledge AMPLIFIES power! The gamblers are recalculating EVERYTHING!\""
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 LEARNED: Herbal Medicine (Level 1). Willow bark = aspirin. Yarrow stops bleeding. Plantain draws out infection. The pharmacy is outside."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "🌟 \"MANTLE TRANSFER DETECTED. ...Oh! New face! Same job! Whole new set of tricks. We hardly noticed. (That is a lie. We noticed. The audience CRIED.)\""
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 The Codex turns a page: Pamela Bauer, 62 days. The mantle passes to Rachel Adeyemi."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "🪞 You wake up somebody else. Rachel Adeyemi, 62 — a bartender. Her hands know different work now: Green Whisper, Scream Cheese, Echo Location."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "The village's quarrel was with Pamela — and Pamela is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "At the grave, Nikolai speaks for Rachel — \"Pamela trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "The fire knew Rachel before the Codex did — her name already carried weight here."
        }
